/* Gemini's own "working" tell is the sparkle avatar spinning beside the
   reply; Mog takes the post instead. content.js stamps data-yume-working on
   the newest model-response for the whole run, and data-yume-latest survives
   after it — Mog is a permanent resident under the newest reply, hopping
   only while Gemini works, exactly like the ChatGPT port. */
